 "hardmode": {
  "comment": "Terraria's world turns hardmode when the Wall of Flesh dies, and so does this one. Everything after that round is tougher, the shop opens two tiers early, and the Hallow exists at all -- before this it should never have been in the rotation, since in Terraria it does not exist until the world turns. Enemy health steps up rather than compounds: the round ramp already compounds, and doing both would put a wall in the run rather than a step.",
